# Normalisasi line ending.
#  - Repo selalu menyimpan LF; checkout di Windows boleh CRLF (autocrlf).
#  - File yang dieksekusi shell / Docker WAJIB LF agar jalan di Linux & CI.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf

# Binaire: jangan pernah disentuh diff/line-ending.
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
